  "name": "luh-oer-sample-data-set",
  "notes": "This data-set includes information about a sample of 8,887 of Open Educational Resources (OERs) from SkillsCommons website. It contains title, description, URL, type, availability date, issued date, subjects, and the availability of following metadata: level, time_required to finish, and accessibility.\r\n\r\nThis data-set has been used to build a metadata scoring and quality prediction model for OERs.",
